# Local asset folders (id Software's copyrighted game assets).
# The game auto-detects these locally and falls back gracefully when
# they are absent, so the hosted build works without them. They are
# intentionally not distributed with this repo.
Doom OST/
Maps/
Guns/*
sprites/*
SFX/*

# The player's own custom weapon art IS part of the repo:
!Guns/My Guns/
!Guns/GunsNoBackground/

# The player's own custom monster art IS part of the repo:
!sprites/ImpCustom.jpg
!sprites/ImpCorpse.jpg
